('advanced-native-929', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-929-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Small repeated contacts helped a connection develop gradually."],"options":["One greeting immediately led to a long conversation on the first day.","The neighbours avoided speaking after the first meeting.","The longer conversations came before the repeated greetings.","Small repeated contacts helped a connection develop gradually."]},"advanced-native-929-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Seeing and greeting one another over several weeks made later conversation easier.","The relationship grew from brief exchanges rather than one dramatic first meeting.","Repeated greetings gave us a small, easy point of contact.","We built a connection one hello at a time before talking for longer."],"options":["Seeing and greeting one another over several weeks made later conversation easier.","The relationship grew from brief exchanges rather than one dramatic first meeting.","Repeated greetings gave us a small, easy point of contact.","We built a connection one hello at a time before talking for longer."]},"advanced-native-929-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["We got to know each other one hello at a time."],"options":["We kept the greetings but became less willing to exchange any words.","We got to know each other one hello at a time.","We discussed our work in detail before ever greeting one another."]},"advanced-native-929-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["The number of greetings alone proves deep trust."],"options":["Brief greetings can be part of gradual relationship-building.","The number of greetings alone proves deep trust.","The wording presents each greeting as a small step."]},"advanced-native-929-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["We are getting to know each other one hello at a time; I would not assume that private questions are welcome."],"options":["We are getting to know each other one hello at a time; I would not assume that private questions are welcome