('advanced-native-931', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-931-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Her responses developed from brief answers into questions and shared experiences."],"options":["Her responses developed from brief answers into questions and shared experiences.","She stopped responding when the garden topic began.","She had been leading the conversation enthusiastically from the first moment.","The group increased the room temperature before she spoke."]},"advanced-native-931-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The shared interest helped her speak more comfortably after the quiet start.","Talking about the garden gave her something she wanted to share.","She warmed up as we talked about the garden and began telling us about her seedlings.","She moved from short replies to asking us questions herself."],"options":["The shared interest helped her speak more comfortably after the quiet start.","Talking about the garden gave her something she wanted to share.","She warmed up as we talked about the garden and began telling us about her seedlings.","She moved from short replies to asking us questions herself."]},"advanced-native-931-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["He warmed up as the rehearsal became more familiar."],"options":["He warmed up as the rehearsal became more familiar.","He had been offering suggestions before the introductions began.","He became less responsive as he learnt how the activity worked."]},"advanced-native-931-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["Her initial short answers proved she disliked the people."],"options":["The surrounding actions can clarify the social meaning.","She became more comfortable or responsive in the exchange.","Her initial short answers proved she disliked the people."]},"advanced-native-931-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["She warmed up once we found a shared interest; the short answers alone do not tell us why she was quiet."],"options":["She warmed up once we found a shared interest; the short answ